# The Emissary San d'Oria 2 (Bastok 2-3, mission.bastok.the_emissary_sandoria2). A level 30 Warrior of Bastok in
# Northern San d'Oria with the mission current (a GM; a GM's Resonance current keeps RoV 1-1's first mission out).
# Status 0: Helaku with no Kindred Crest answers a message, no event. Shakir plays 538 at every point of the flow,
# which is also his own zone default, so replay cannot tell the mission's event(538) from the default (a fake check
# pins it). With the Kindred Crest: Helaku 545, whose finish completes the mission, begins The Emissary, moves to
# status 11, takes the crest and gives the Kindred Report; Helaku then plays 557 (The Emissary is now current).
lists ChateauDoraguille/Halver/onTrigger ChateauDoraguille/onEventFinish/503 HorlaisPeak/onEventFinish/32001 NorthernSanDoria/Helaku/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/Shakir/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/545
char zone=NorthernSanDoria pos=36,-2,-2 job=WAR lvl=30 nation=1
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Bastok TheEmissarySandoria2 current
login
trigger Helaku
finish-if-event
trigger Shakir
finish-if-event
missionstatus Bastok 9
trigger Shakir
finish-if-event
keyitem KindredCrest
trigger Helaku
finish
trigger Helaku
finish-if-event
trigger Shakir
finish-if-event
